    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "Anguished beings in darkness around the tunnel begging for help; stern male voice warning about rules and that they could drag her into darkness. End-of-tunnel realm described as innumerable spherical lights with filament-like white lines. Later veridical-style OBE to hospital 4th-floor waiting room by the river; husband reportedly saw her pass through the room/window as “fuzzy TV reception,” and noted the clock at 8:00.",
